## 2. Screenshot Protection

### SetWindowDisplayAffinity (Windows 10+)
```cpp
#include <windows.h>

// Exclude window from screen capture
BOOL result = SetWindowDisplayAffinity(hwnd, WDA_EXCLUDEFROMCAPTURE);
if (!result) {
    // Handle error - feature may not be supported
    DWORD error = GetLastError();
}
```

### Additional Screenshot Protection Notes
- `WDA_EXCLUDEFROMCAPTURE` prevents the window from appearing in:
  - Screenshots (Print Screen)
  - Screen recordings
  - Screen sharing applications
  - Window capture utilities
- Only available on Windows 10 version 2000 and later
- Some advanced screen capture tools may still bypass this protection

